$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=revmachc  LOC_AFTER=?

* The reverse machine reverses its input within ` ( # ` W ) + 1 ` steps, derived from the fragment calculus.  The same statement as ~ revmach , whose proof the calculus replaces from ~ revcfg on.

